      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The doctor looked at me and said:\n\n\u201cYou know this could cost a lot of money.\u201d\n\nSir\u2026 it\u2019s my mother.\n\nWatch the full conversation now on YouTube. \n\n#whatnow\n\nVideo",
